  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming Livestock Mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical government-to-government (G2G) study visit serves to welcome the new Tanzanian Minister of Livestock &amp; Fisheries and is an extension of the collaboration between the Dutch and Tanzanian government on bridging their poultry sectors. In light of the expiration of the current Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) on facilitating the enabling environment of the Tanzanian poultry sector, this study visit serves to identify new fields for collaboration between the Dutch and Tanzanian poultry sectors in order to create more local income and employment.</narrative>
  </description>
